  "prefLabel": "Env-C 502.17 Roster",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-C 502.17 “Roster” means the list maintained by the department that identifies the firms who have been prequalified pursuant to this chapter in the particular category for which the firms are prequalified.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-C 500) #10644, eff 7-22-14; ss by #14060, eff 8-21-24 (formerly Env-C 502.18)",
